DEBUG:true/false=
ALLOWED_HOSTS:"...,...,"=
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS:"...,...,"=
POSTGRE:true/false=
USE_PROD_DB_DURING_DEBUG:true/false=
DB_NAME:string=
DB_USER:string=
DB_PASS:string=
DB_HOST:string=
DB_PORT:number=
SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH:string=
FCM_URL:string=
OTP_EXPIRY_SECONDS:number (default 1200 = 20 minutes)=POSTGRES_MIGRATE_USER:string, the role manage.py migrate signs in as (deploy/db_roles.sql)=
POSTGRES_MIGRATE_PASSWORD:string=
FIELD_ENCRYPTION_KEYS:comma separated Fernet keys, newest first; empty derives one from SECRET_KEY=
PRIVATE_MEDIA_ROOT:string, identity documents, never served by the web server (default private_media)=
DOCUMENT_LINK_SECONDS:number (default 3600)=
ENFORCE_STAFF_PERMISSIONS:true/false (default true)=
ICLOCK_REQUIRE_PUSH_KEY:true/false (default false, until every reader has a key)=
